  "primary": {
    "remotePath": "/root/rivermind-data/shao-lean-20261021/sources/current/c12/supplement.tex",
    "bytes": 235015,
    "sha256": "b99f2ac4d2f39dd39772d98a5702b7a923c2f10f8730a08fc1b4cd6bba4742bd",
    "scopeLines": [
      {
        "line": 4431,
        "text": "We prove a master at any cutoff $b>0$. Put"
      },
      {
        "line": 4432,
        "text": "$a_0(s)=1$, $a_1(s)=a_3(s)$, $M_0=1$, $M_1=|X_1|^3$,"
      },
      {
        "line": 4433,
        "text": "and let $\\gamma=-c$ if $E[A;A\\le b]\\ge1/2$, and $\\gamma=C$"
      },
      {
        "line": 4434,
        "text": "otherwise. For $\\ell\\in\\{0,1\\}$, fixed $p\\ge0,q>0$, and"
      },
      {
        "line": 4435,
        "text": "$H\\in[b,\\infty]$, the master is"
      },
      {
        "line": 4436,
        "text": "\\begin{gather}"
      },
      {
        "line": 4437,
        "text": " E[M_\\ell|d|^pe^{-sT}]"
      },
      {
        "line": 4438,
        "text": " \\le C_ps^{-p/2}a_\\ell(s/2)e^{\\gamma s(t-\\ell)},"
      },
      {
        "line": 4439,
        "text": "       \\qquad0<s\\le2/b,                              \\label{cnx:dampedmoment}\\\\"
      },
      {
        "line": 4440,
        "text": " E[1_{\\{b\\le T<H\\}}M_\\ell T^{-q/2}(1+|d|/\\sqrt T)^p]"
      },
      {
        "line": 4441,
        "text": " \\le C_{p,q}\\int_0^{1/b}s^{q/2-1}a_\\ell(s/2)"
      },
      {
        "line": 4442,
        "text": "                   e^{\\gamma(s+1/H)(t-\\ell)}\\,ds,      \\label{cnx:dampedbudget}"
      },
      {
        "line": 4443,
        "text": "\\end{gather}"
      },
      {
        "line": 4444,
        "text": "where $1/\\infty=0$. No third moment is assumed."
      },
      {
        "line": 4445,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 4446,
        "text": "Set $a=(1-e^{-2})/4$, $\\lambda=a/4$, and"
      },
      {
        "line": 4447,
        "text": "$\\psi_\\epsilon(s)=Ee^{-sX^2+\\epsilon\\lambda\\sqrt sX}$,"
      },
      {
        "line": 4448,
        "text": "$\\epsilon=\\pm1$. Centering and $1-e^{-u^2}\\le|u|$ give"
      },
      {
        "line": 4449,
        "text": "$|E[Xe^{-sX^2}]|\\le\\sqrt s$. The inequality"
      },
      {
        "line": 4450,
        "text": "$e^v\\le1+v+v^2e^{|v|}/2$ and"
      },
      {
        "line": 4451,
        "text": "$-u^2+\\lambda|u|\\le\\lambda^2/4$ yield"
      },
      {
        "line": 4452,
        "text": "\\["
      },
      {
        "line": 4453,
        "text": " \\psi_\\epsilon(s)\\le Ee^{-sX^2}+(\\lambda+\\lambda^2)s"
      },
      {
        "line": 4454,
        "text": " \\le e^{Cs}."
      },
      {
        "line": 4455,
        "text": "\\]"
      },
      {
        "line": 4456,
        "text": "If $E[A;A\\le b]\\ge1/2$ and $s\\le2/b$, concavity on $[0,2]$"
      },
      {
        "line": 4457,
        "text": "gives"
      },
      {
        "line": 4458,
        "text": "\\["
      },
      {
        "line": 4459,
        "text": " 1-Ee^{-sA}\\ge\\frac{1-e^{-2}}2sE[A;A\\le b]\\ge as."
      },
      {
        "line": 4460,
        "text": "\\]"
      },
      {
        "line": 4461,
        "text": "Since $\\lambda+\\lambda^2\\le a/2$, now"
      },
      {
        "line": 4462,
        "text": "$\\psi_\\epsilon(s)\\le e^{-cs}$ with $c=a/2$."
      },
      {
        "line": 4463,
        "text": "Completing the square gives"
      },
      {
        "line": 4464,
        "text": "\\["
      },
      {
        "line": 4465,
        "text": " E[|X|^3e^{-sX^2+\\epsilon\\lambda\\sqrt sX}]"
      },
      {
        "line": 4466,
        "text": " \\le e^{\\lambda^2/2}a_3(s/2)."
      },
      {
        "line": 4467,
        "text": "\\]"
      },
      {
        "line": 4468,
        "text": "Absorb $|\\sqrt s d|^p$ by"
      },
      {
        "line": 4469,
        "text": "$C_p(e^{\\lambda\\sqrt s d}+e^{-\\lambda\\sqrt s d})$ and multiply"
      },
      {
        "line": 4470,
        "text": "the independent coordinate factors. There are $t$ unmarked factors,"
      },
      {
        "line": 4471,
        "text": "or one marked factor and $t-1$ unmarked factors. This proves"
      },
      {
        "line": 4472,
        "text": "\\eqref{cnx:dampedmoment}."
      },
      {
        "line": 4473,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 4474,
        "text": "For $T\\ge b$ and $\\nu>0$,"
      },
      {
        "line": 4475,
        "text": "\\["
      },
      {
        "line": 4476,
        "text": " T^{-\\nu}\\le C_\\nu\\int_0^{1/b}s^{\\nu-1}e^{-sT}\\,ds,"
      },
      {
        "line": 4477,
        "text": "\\]"
      },
      {
        "line": 4478,
        "text": "by substituting $u=sT$, whose upper endpoint is at least one."
      },
      {
        "line": 4479,
        "text": "Also $1_{\\{T<H\\}}\\le e e^{-T/H}$. Apply the integral bound with"
      },
      {
        "line": 4480,
        "text": "$\\nu=q/2$ and $(p+q)/2$, using"
      },
      {
        "line": 4481,
        "text": "$(1+v)^p\\le C_p(1+v^p)$. In \\eqref{cnx:dampedmoment} set"
      },
      {
        "line": 4482,
        "text": "$u=s+1/H\\le2/b$; monotonicity gives"
      },
      {
        "line": 4483,
        "text": "$a_\\ell(u/2)\\le a_\\ell(s/2)$ and $u^{-p/2}\\le s^{-p/2}$."
      },
      {
        "line": 4484,
        "text": "This proves \\eqref{cnx:dampedbudget} by Tonelli; pointwise damped moments"
      },
      {
        "line": 4485,
        "text": "are finite under the second-moment assumption."
      }
    ]
  },
